### getDocument
GET {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/get-document?userId=user_123&documentId=your-document-id

### listDocuments
GET {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/list-documents?userId=user_123&page=1&size=20&status=published

### listVersions
GET {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/list-versions?userId=user_123&documentId=your-document-id

### getEtlStatus
GET {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/get-etl-status?userId=user_123&documentId=your-document-id
